<title>USA: FGIC qualifies four issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies four issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co. said it has qualified for municipal bond insurance the following four municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Tucson, Ariz., $11.7 million water supply system revenue bonds and $5 million revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Hillman Community Schools, Mich., $8.345 million school building and site bonds.</p>
<p>--Barton County USD, Kan., $9.75 million school GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
